'''Koronium''' (メタルコアラッキョ ''Metaru Koarakkyo'', '''Metal Koalakkyo''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Kory]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]].

