==Enemy==
Koronium is a dangerous Metal enemy. Don't let his 150 health fool you, as Koronium, just like most [[Kory]] variants, is able to create a powerful [[Wave Attack]] covering an area of 1067.5 each time he hits a unit. Koronium also has more range (240) and attack power (15,000) than other variants.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] are almost mandatory to turn this eccentric koala into scrap metal. Do not use anything with a range less than 240 (except perhaps [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shields]]). These units will only be stepping stones for Koronium to unleash a wave and shred the rest of your units. The use of Wave Shields is recommended to try to blot out his Wave Attacks. Lower-ranged Wave Shields like [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] will not survive long enough to protect other units, so it's better to deploy equivalents with superior range like  [[Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo (Uber Rare Cat)|Hatsune Miku: MM2020 Tokyo]], [[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-00]],the true form of [[Gloomy Neneko (Super Rare Cat)|Gloomy Neneko]] and [[Mighty Kristul Muu (Legend Rare Cat)|Doom Engine Pandora]], though luring is needed with Pandora due to its very low speed.

He hits considerably hard up close, so getting past his range buffer of 240 by using ranged [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hitters]] such as [[Million-Dollar Cat (Special Cat)|Hundred-Million-Dollar Cat]], [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]], [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Marine Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] with [[Talents]] is worth it. Talented [[Panties Cat (Special Cat)|Lollycat]] is also very good at delaying him, though beware that it requires a lot of NP for a powerful yet situational Talent.

[[Kubiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|E. Kubilan Pasalan]] is probably the best answer to Koronium, as it can generate a level 8 Wave Attack with 100% Critical Chance, with enough damage to instantly remove Koronium. [[Hayabusa (Uber Rare Cat)|Hayabusa]] can also do so if he crits, having LD to target Koronium within a cluster of metals.

